    "volume": 602,
    "author": {
      "canonical": "汪遵",
      "recorded": "汪遵",
      "gender": "male",
      "english_name": "Wang Zun",
      "wikidata_id": "Q22098887"
    },
    "title": "晉河",
    "poem": [
      "風引征帆管吹高，晉君張宴俟雄豪。",
      "舟人笑指千餘客，誰是煙霄六翮毛。"
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "QTS_602_022_01",
    "volume": 602,
    "author": {
      "canonical": "汪遵",
      "recorded": "汪遵",
      "gender": "male",
      "english_name": "Wang Zun",
      "wikidata_id": "Q22098887"
    },
    "title": "干將墓",
    "poem": [
      "橐籥冰霜萬古聞，拍灰鬆地見餘墳。",
      "應緣神劍飛揚久，水水山山盡是雲。"
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "QTS_602_023_01",
    "volume": 602,
    "author": {
      "canonical": "汪遵",
      "recorded": "汪遵",
      "gender": "male",
      "english_name": "Wang Zun",
      "wikidata_id": "Q22098887"
    },
    "title": "金谷",
    "poem": [
      "晉臣榮盛更誰過，常向階前舞翠娥。",
      "香散艷消如一夢，但留風月伴煙蘿。"
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "QTS_602_024_01",
    "volume": 602,
    "author": {
      "canonical": "汪遵",
      "recorded": "汪遵",
      "gender": "male",
      "english_name": "Wang Zun",
      "wikidata_id": "Q22098887"
    },
    "title": "三閭廟",
    "poem": [
      "為嫌朝野盡陶陶，不覺官高怨亦高。",
      "憔悴莫酬漁父笑，浪交千載詠離騷。"
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "QTS_602_025_01",
    "volume": 602,
    "author": {
      "canonical": "汪遵",
      "recorded": "汪遵",
      "gender": "male",
      "english_name": "Wang Zun",
      "wikidata_id": "Q22098887"
    },
    "title": "易水",
    "poem": [
      "匕首空磨事不成，誤留龍袂待琴聲。",
      "斯須卻作秦中鬼，青史徒標烈士名。"
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "QTS_602_026_01",
    "volume": 602,
    "author": {
      "canonical": "汪遵",
      "recorded": "汪遵",
      "gender": "male",
      "english_name": "Wang Zun",
      "wikidata_id": "Q22098887"
    },
    "title": "嚴陵臺",
    "poem": [
      "一釣淒涼在杳冥，故人飛詔入山扃。",
      "終將寵辱輕軒冕，高臥五云為客星。"
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "QTS_602_027_01",
    "volume": 602,
    "author": {
      "canonical": "汪遵",
      "recorded": "汪遵",
      "gender": "male",
      "english_name": "Wang Zun",
      "wikidata_id": "Q22098887"
    },
    "title": "淮陰",
    "poem": [
      "秦季賢愚混不分，只應漂母識王孫。",
      "歸榮便累千金贈，為報當時一飯恩。"
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "QTS_602_028_01",
    "volume": 602,
    "author": {
      "canonical": "汪遵",
      "recorded": "汪遵",
      "gender": "male",
      "english_name": "Wang Zun",
      "wikidata_id": "Q22098887"
    },
    "title": "雞鳴曲",
    "poem": [
      "金距花冠傍舍棲，清晨相叫一聲齊。",
      "開關自有馮生計，不必天明待汝啼。"
    ]
  },
  {
